# Drawing Register Application Overview

This is a Windows desktop application built with .NET for managing and tracking drawing registers. The application is structured as follows:

## Main Components
- [DrawingRegister.App/MainWindow.xaml.cs](mdc:DrawingRegister.App/MainWindow.xaml.cs) - Main application window and core functionality
- [DrawingRegister.App/BatchEditDialog.xaml.cs](mdc:DrawingRegister.App/BatchEditDialog.xaml.cs) - Batch editing functionality
- [DrawingRegister.App/DistributionInfoDialog.xaml.cs](mdc:DrawingRegister.App/DistributionInfoDialog.xaml.cs) - Distribution information handling

## Project Structure
- `Models/` - Contains data models and business logic
- `Data/` - Data access and persistence
- `Helpers/` - Utility classes and helper functions
- `Converters/` - Data conversion and transformation logic
- `Resources/` - Application resources and assets

